A function declared inside another function isn't listed, while a class's method is listed one level deeper as a class member.
== args
input/nested.ts
== file input/nested.ts
function outer(): void {
  function inner(): void {}
}

class Box {
  method(): void {}
}

const top = 1;
== stdout
input/nested.ts (9 lines)
[L1-L3] function outer(): void
[L5-L7] class Box
  [L6-L6] method(): void
[L9-L9] const top
== stderr
== exit 0
